        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFCC;strokeColor=#888888;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" value="All containers share one Docker bridge network (service name = hostname).&lt;br&gt;Public entry point: Traefik :80. Simulator connects to RabbitMQ on localhost:5672.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Black&lt;/b&gt;: HTTP / JDBC (request-reply). &lt;font color=&quot;#B85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Red dashed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: AMQP messaging (asynchronous).&lt;br&gt;Sync: topic exchange, one queue per subscriber (publish/subscribe).&lt;br&gt;Measurements: single queue (point-to-point)." vertex="1">
